{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>鼎湖山</p>\n<img alt=\"七星岩\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1030664/block/singleImage/3085633/df/01KRKQ84SPKG1TXF28C16JP0D3.jpg?updatedAt=1778778579\"/>\n<p>七星岩</p>\n<img alt=\"馳名肇慶牡丹雞\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1030664/block/singleImage/3085634/df/01KRKQ850H8REYJYYJJDQPS92Y.jpg?updatedAt=1778778579\"/>\n<p>馳名肇慶牡丹雞</p>\n<img alt=\"酒店外觀\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1030664/block/singleImage/3085635/df/01KRKQ84ZMMXQMCVB17GNTSP60.jpg?updatedAt=1778778579\"/>\n<p>酒店外觀</p>\n<p>團號：CH234</p>\n<p>團費：平日$368(平日單人房差$100)</p>\n<p>暢遊經典景區「廣東四大名山之鼎湖山景區」、「七星岩景區」及全新開業《肇慶潮漫酒店》及《牡丹雞皇美食》純玩足2天</p>\n<p>入住：2026年全新裝修《肇慶潮漫酒店》或同級規格酒店</p>\n<p>安排品嘗：《鼎湖誠心素食宴》《鼎湖牡丹雞皇宴》《肇慶農家三件寶美食宴》</p>\n<p>查詢電話：2626 0102(八達旅遊)</p>\n<p>Whatsapp 熱線：9293 2808</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T21:20:39.926972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"unknown"}}